This product contains code adapted from Apache Paimon Rust, specifically
table/sort_merge.rs at commit 6824487813c69b1d4975e1add8c37343b3ead75b.

Merge ordering and delete policies are adapted from Apache Paimon 2.0.0,
specifically LoserTree, SortMergeReaderWithLoserTree, UserDefinedSeqComparator,
DeduplicateMergeFunction, FirstRowMergeFunction, PartialUpdateMergeFunction and
ReducerMergeFunctionWrapper.

Legacy numeric aggregation semantics follow Apache Paimon 1.0.0
FieldSumAgg and FieldProductAgg.

